Concept	How I Used It
Functions	Created check_password() to evaluate passwords
String methods	Used .isupper(), .islower(), and .isdigit()
Boolean flags	Tracked whether each character type was found
for loop	Checked each character and displayed tips
Lists	Stored improvement tips
append()	Added missing requirements to the tips list
return	Returned the score and tips
Tuple unpacking	Stored the returned values in score and tips
if-elif-else	Classified password strength
len()	Checked password length and whether tips existed
Membership operator (in)	Checked special characters
